      "text": "Within a server: NVLink joins GPUs through NVLink Switch.\nBetween servers: ConnectX NICs join an InfiniBand fabric.\nTraining software: CUDA and NCCL. GPUDirect RDMA can be used on supported paths.\nSimplified topology. Only selected components and links are shown.",
